#==============================================================================================
#
#   document_h_2 - DOM::Document: the inline functions of Document.h (accessors, part 2)
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of the functions defined in LibWeb/DOM/Document.h (lines 656-1121), in the
#       header's order: the style and layout update flags, favicons, initial about:blank,
#       the pending scroll events, the load timing info, the script lists, the execCommand
#       state and value overrides, the iteration templates over shadow roots, and the
#       private template notify_each_document_observer (as one function per notifier, at
#       the end).
#
#==============================================================================================

# mark: Accessors (continued) ===================================================================

